# reeses.mtb

noecho
note This macro will simulate random sampling of Reese's Pieces,
note keeping track of the number of orange candies in each sample.
note
note The user is to specify the population proportion of orange candies,
note the number of samples to be simulated, and the size of each sample.
note
note ***** Do you want to proceed? *****
yesno k1
exec 'reeses\reeses1.mtb' k1
echo
end

